"promobox__title\">Préparer individuellement son avenir</h2>\n    <strong class=\"promobox__subtitle\"></strong>\n  </header>\n  \n  <div class=\"promobox__text richtext\">\n    <p>Les besoins en matière de prévoyance peuvent évoluer en fonction des phases de la vie. Quelles sont vos priorités de prévoyance?</p>\n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"promobox__action_container\">\n    \n    \n  \n    \n    \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc.clientlibs/pfch/clientlibs/shared/dialog/common/primarySecondaryButtons.pf-20260819134901.min.css\" type=\"text/css\">\n\n\n\n  \n\n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n  <div class=\"primary-secondary-buttons primary-secondary-buttons__direction--column \">\n    <div>\n      <a class=\"styled-button styled-button--primary\" href=\"/content/pfch/fr/priv/planning#1d00e7\" target=\"_self\">\n        \n        \n        <span class=\"button__label\">Consulter l’aperçu</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"promobox-component\"><div class=\"promobox petrol\" id=\"00f437\">\n  <header class=\"promobox__header\">\n    <h2 class=\"promobox__title\">Planifier sa retraite</h2>\n    <strong class=\"promobox__subtitle\"></strong>\n  </header>\n  \n  <div class=\"promobox__text richtext\">\n    <p>Faites le point sur votre situation personnelle en matière de prévoyance vieillesse.</p>\n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"promobox__action_container\">\n    \n    \n  \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n  <div class=\"primary-secondary-buttons primary-secondary-buttons__direction--column \">\n    <div>\n      <a class=\"styled-button styled-button--primary\" href=\"/content/pfch/fr/support/services/tool\" target=\"_self\">\n        \n        \n        <span class=\"button__label\">Accéder au calculateur</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>","scrHintLivingExpensesHigh":"<div class=\"tipbox-component\">\n\n\n    \n<link rel=\